NEARS-2298 QA cycle 2 (fix NEARS-2383 applied, HEAD 9109f05f) — re-demonstrate AC3 + AC4
regression check + happy-path sweep.

Device: emulator-5570 (own lock, key NEARS-2298). Backend: isolated dedicated
`php artisan serve --host=127.0.0.1 --port=8298`, DB copy `multi_food_db_qa2298c`
(dumped from the shared dev DB, --set-gtid-purged=OFF). UserApp launched with
`--dart-define=API_HOST=10.0.2.2:8298` so it never touches the shared dev backend.
Repro condition: real login as customer@nears.com (user_id 6) on-device, then the
minted oauth_access_tokens row(s) revoked directly in the isolated DB copy, then a
cold boot (am force-stop + am start) with the now-stale token still in local
secure storage — the same real repro cycle-1 used, NOT a true zero-token guest
(which never calls cm-firebase-token at all).

